      "integration_review": "RC54 Core API 15 PhysicalMaterials thermalResistance is authoritative for series wall resistance. Thermal owns cladding placement, geometric thickness and room air evolution; API exposes the actual face query used by the solver. Straw uses vanilla hay fire hooks, clay is nonflammable; native block lifecycle invalidates actual room state, so no separate fire capability or duplicate material table is needed."
    },
